      "writtenOn": "2022-04-14T12:40:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We definitely have a sub-section in .text for the hyp code, see https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/common/+/refs/heads/android13-5.10/arch/arm64/kernel/vmlinux.lds.S#92\n\nThe prefixing is done by some objcopy magic when creating the EL2 object, see https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/common/+/refs/heads/android13-5.10/arch/arm64/kvm/hyp/nvhe/Makefile#83\n\nSo, I really think hyp_debug_service_testpoint() is currently not reachable from EL2 as it falls outside of the .hyp.text section and it isn\u0027t mapped in the hypervisor stage-1. Interestingly, accessing this will in fact panic the hypervisor, but clearly that is \u0027luck\u0027 in this case :)",
